<title>USA: Computer Access buys computer distributor.</title>
<headline>Computer Access buys computer distributor.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Computer Access International Inc said Wednesday that it signed a letter of intent to acquire a computer equipment distributor and service company located in Miami.</p>
<p>Neither terms nor the name of the company being bought were disclosed.</p>
<p>Signing of an acquisition agreement is expected within 30 days, Computer Access said.</p>
